<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<GameProfile xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
	<GamePath></GamePath>
	<TestMenuParameter></TestMenuParameter>
	<TestMenuIsExecutable>false</TestMenuIsExecutable>
	<ExtraParameters></ExtraParameters>
	<TestMenuExtraParameters></TestMenuExtraParameters>
	<GameProfileRevision>10</GameProfileRevision>
	<Is64Bit>true</Is64Bit>
	<HasSeparateTestMode>false</HasSeparateTestMode>
	<EmulationProfile>SAO</EmulationProfile>
	<EmulatorType>TeknoParrot</EmulatorType>
	<ExecutableName>link.exe</ExecutableName>
	<OnlineIdFieldName>AccessCode</OnlineIdFieldName>
	<OnlineIdType>SaoAccessCode</OnlineIdType>
	<OnlineProfileURL>https://teknoparrot.com/OnlineProfile/Sao</OnlineProfileURL>
	<ConfigValues>
		<FieldInformation>
			<CategoryName>General</CategoryName>
			<FieldName>Input API</FieldName>
			<FieldValue>DirectInput</FieldValue>
			<FieldType>Dropdown</FieldType>
			<FieldOptions>
				<string>DirectInput</string>
				<string>XInput</string>
			</FieldOptions>
		</FieldInformation>
		<FieldInformation>
			<CategoryName>General</CategoryName>
			<FieldName>Windowed</FieldName>
			<FieldValue>0</FieldValue>
			<FieldType>Bool</FieldType>
		</FieldInformation>
    	<FieldInformation>
			<CategoryName>General</CategoryName>
			<FieldName>Use Keyboard/Button For Axis</FieldName>
			<FieldValue>0</FieldValue>
			<FieldType>Bool</FieldType>
		</FieldInformation>
		<FieldInformation>
			<CategoryName>General</CategoryName>
			<FieldName>Keyboard/Button Axis X/Y Sensitivity</FieldName>
			<FieldValue>10</FieldValue>
			<FieldType>Slider</FieldType>
			<FieldMin>1</FieldMin>
			<FieldMax>127</FieldMax>
			<FieldOptions></FieldOptions>
		</FieldInformation>
		<FieldInformation>
			<CategoryName>General</CategoryName>
			<FieldName>TerminalMode</FieldName>
			<VisibleWhen>Online</VisibleWhen>
			<VisibleWhenValue>Debug</VisibleWhenValue>
			<FieldValue>0</FieldValue>
			<FieldType>Bool</FieldType>
			<Hint>Hidden: TeknoParrotUI's Terminal button starts the game as the terminal (gasha, card printing) for that launch; Play starts the satellite. On the terminal, F2 touches the card.</Hint>
		</FieldInformation>
		<FieldInformation>
			<CategoryName>Network</CategoryName>
			<FieldName>Online</FieldName>
			<FieldValue>1</FieldValue>
			<FieldType>Bool</FieldType>
			<Hint>Play online: cards, progress, rankings and co-op on TeknoParrot's SAO server. When the server does not answer at startup, the game plays offline. Off = always the game's offline mode.</Hint>
		</FieldInformation>
		<FieldInformation>
			<CategoryName>Network</CategoryName>
			<FieldName>Arcade</FieldName>
			<FieldValue></FieldValue>
			<FieldType>Text</FieldType>
			<Hint>The arcade this cabinet plays at. Friends who enter the same name share one store: in-store co-op and the store ranking. Empty = an arcade of its own. Up to 20 characters: letters, digits, spaces and . - _ (case does not matter).</Hint>
		</FieldInformation>
		<FieldInformation>
			<CategoryName>Card</CategoryName>
			<FieldName>AccessCode</FieldName>
			<FieldValue></FieldValue>
			<FieldType>Text</FieldType>
			<Hint>Your access code (20 digits): your player, on any PC. Filled in by TeknoParrotUI from your teknoparrot.com account (Online Profiles > Sword Art Online Arcade, also shown on the Account page); without a login, type it in. TeknoParrot's server takes only these codes. Keep it private: anyone who has it plays as you.</Hint>
		</FieldInformation>
		<FieldInformation>
			<CategoryName>Card</CategoryName>
			<FieldName>PlayerName</FieldName>
			<FieldValue></FieldValue>
			<FieldType>Text</FieldType>
			<Hint>Your name in the game, up to 16 characters (the game has no name entry). Empty = the server's default name.</Hint>
		</FieldInformation>
	</ConfigValues>
